@Nicolas Peralta Baron Completely missed this 😅 mate. It depends on the level of hypothesis i have. But my entry to the game was V0 for a long time I was prototyping on V0 and then passing over validated ideas to the team.

Recently played around with things like lovable it’s sort of similar to V0 just for low level prototypes but issue is it doesn’t work well for a collaborative system. Might be fine for solo projects.

Since I’ve got better using Cursor/Windsurf I can prototype better and therefore validate or invalidate more complex things easily without any other team member. As you know not every hypothesis has the need for building UI.
